OL,3,AComedian Karen Dunbar cancels tour
OL,4,Adates claiming promoter has not paid
OL,5,Aher
OL,6,
OL,7,FComedian Karen Dunbar has cancelled
OL,8,Fmost of her upcoming tour, claiming she
OL,9,Fhas not been paid by her promoter for
OL,10,Fprevious shows.
OL,12,FIn a video posted on social media, the
OL,13,FChewin' the Fat star said she was
OL,14,F"gutted" and apologised to fans.
OL,16,FDunbar claimed she had only been paid
OL,17,Ffor five of her previous 39 tour dates,
OL,18,Fa claim disputed by promoter Breakneck
OL,19,FComedy.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
