OL,3,AComedian Karen Dunbar cancels tour
OL,4,Adates claiming promoter has not paid
OL,5,Aher
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn an online statement the promoter
OL,8,Fsaid it asked Dunbar during the tour to
OL,9,Frenegotiate her previously agreed fees
OL,10,Fto help the company "minimise its
OL,11,Flosses" after ticket sales for the tour
OL,12,Fwere slower than expected.
